WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:23.756
Brad: Something definitely happened that time!

2
00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:28.471
Danny: I told you I had a powerful imagination!

3
00:00:28.472 --> 00:00:31.550
Brad: Where . . . where are we?

4
00:00:31.551 --> 00:00:41.502
Danny: Either we made things really, really big or . . .

5
00:00:41.503 --> 00:00:45.088
Danny: Or we're really, really small!

6
00:00:45.089 --> 00:00:46.384
Brad: Wait a minute.

7
00:00:46.385 --> 00:00:48.337
We weren't supposed to shrink.

8
00:00:48.338 --> 00:00:51.638
Brad: The bullies were supposed to get big again.

9
00:00:51.639 --> 00:01:00.642
Danny: This is so cool!

10
00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:03.816
Danny: Hi, ant! You look pretty big now!

11
00:01:03.817 --> 00:01:13.019
Danny: Sorry if I squashed some of your friends yesterday! Ha-ha!

12
00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:19.292
Brad: Danny! Where did you go? Oh, great.

13
00:01:19.293 --> 00:01:21.956
Brad: I wonder where they're going.

14
00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:27.132
Danny! Danny! Danny!

15
00:01:27.133 --> 00:01:29.492
Danny: Whoa! What's that?

16
00:01:29.493 --> 00:01:33.034
Danny: He won't sting me because he can't see me.

17
00:01:33.035 --> 00:01:35.900
Being tiny is the best!

18
00:01:35.901 --> 00:01:40.123
Danny: Think of all the places I can get into now.

19
00:01:40.124 --> 00:01:49.095
Mr. Smith: That Danny can be a lot of trouble, but he's [n3@the best art student I've ever had.

20
00:01:49.096 --> 00:01:55.491
Danny: This is going to be a lot of fun.

21
00:01:55.492 --> 00:01:58.586
Mr. Smith: Ow! Do you see something in my eye?

22
00:01:58.587 --> 00:02:03.979
Mr. Smith: Is there a bug in my eye? Ow! Ow!

23
00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:11.090
Danny: Now I'll tickle his nose. Hee-hee!

24
00:02:11.091 --> 00:02:24.119
Mr. Smith: Ah . . . ah . . . ah-choo!

25
00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:28.385
Danny: Ha-ha-ha! I can't wait to try that.

26
00:02:28.386 --> 00:02:32.716
Brad: That's his laugh!

27
00:02:32.717 --> 00:02:34.007
Brad: Danny.

28
00:02:34.008 --> 00:02:36.764
Danny: Huh? Oh, it's you.

29
00:02:36.765 --> 00:02:40.104
Brad: You shouldn't run off like that.

30
00:02:40.105 --> 00:02:43.143
Danny: Brad, being small is the best!

31
00:02:43.144 --> 00:02:45.790
The possibilities are endless.

32
00:02:45.791 --> 00:02:53.516
Brad: Look out!

33
00:02:53.517 --> 00:02:57.284
Danny: Ugh! I'm covered in worm muck!

34
00:02:57.285 --> 00:02:59.464
Brad: Are you okay?

35
00:02:59.465 --> 00:03:01.624
Danny: Yes, I'm okay.

36
00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:06.645
Maybe being small isn't so great.

37
00:03:06.646 --> 00:03:09.995
Brad: You just have to watch out for the worms.

38
00:03:09.996 --> 00:03:12.203
Danny: That stupid shrink-gun.

39
00:03:12.204 --> 00:03:18.453
Danny: It was supposed to unshrink the bullies, not shrink us.

40
00:03:18.454 --> 00:03:22.747
Brad: Well, now that we're small, it should be easier to find them.

41
00:03:22.748 --> 00:03:25.465
Danny: I'm not sure that's a good idea, Brad.

42
00:03:25.466 --> 00:03:30.560
Danny: If we're as small as them, then they can beat us up again!

43
00:03:30.561 --> 00:03:33.185
Danny: I think you should make us big again.

44
00:03:33.186 --> 00:03:36.397
Brad: That's why we have to find them.

45
00:03:36.398 --> 00:03:38.829
Danny: What do you mean?

46
00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:41.346
Brad: Do you see the shrink-gun anywhere?

47
00:03:41.347 --> 00:03:42.783
Danny: No.

48
00:03:42.784 --> 00:03:47.886
Brad: Without it, I don't know how to make us big again.

49
00:03:47.887 --> 00:03:51.739
Danny: What does that have to do with finding those two bullies?

50
00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:55.643
Brad: If we find Chuck and Dave, I can examine them.

51
00:03:55.644 --> 00:04:00.789
Brad: A careful inspection will help me discover how to unshrink all of us.

52
00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:08.593
Danny: Well, let's start looking.

53
00:04:08.594 --> 00:04:11.093
Danny: Gross! What are those?

54
00:04:11.094 --> 00:04:12.531
Brad: Those are mites.

55
00:04:12.532 --> 00:04:14.874
They're excited about something.

56
00:04:14.875 --> 00:04:17.471
Let's go listen!

57
00:04:17.472 --> 00:04:22.231
Mite: The ants will pay us well for the humans! Ha-ha-ha!

58
00:04:22.232 --> 00:04:26.801
Danny & Brad: They've got the bullies!
